  "plain": "For about 80 years there has been a deliberate, well-funded campaign to make people who take UFOs seriously look foolish, and it began after the Robertson Panel, a group of scientists the CIA convened in 1953 to review UFO reports. So says Tim Gallaudet, a retired Navy rear admiral, who calls the campaign \"very effective\". If he is right, the stigma around the subject was built on purpose."
